[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    83[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 12 | `driver` | options: none. *randomized* near-overflow band `x ∈ [INT_MIN/2 - 4096, INT_MIN/2 + 4096]`, fixed seed, 8000 draws; fully buffered | [x] |
