[38;5;252m[1m## What the library is[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mc_src[0m is a single translation unit exposing one function, [38;5;10mvoid driver(int x)[0m, which computes [38;5;10m2*x + 300[0m and [38;5;10mprintf("%d\n", ...)[0ms it. That smallness is the substantive finding: it collapses most of the phase structure (no error surface, no options, no features, no second module), and the artifacts record [3mwhy[23m each collapse is derived rather than assumed.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Phase artifacts ([38;5;10mtranslation/[0m)[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mSYMBOLS.md[0m** — C [38;5;10m.so[0m defines exactly one strong symbol, [38;5;10mdriver[0m. Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m defines it too. [38;5;10mcomm -23[0m diff is empty for both the release and dev profiles. All undefined Rust symbols are glibc/libgcc-unwind imports. No module was skipped, so nothing needed translating.[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m** — the error table is [1mempty by derivation[22m, not by omission. A mechanical grep for [38;5;10mreturn[0m/[38;5;10massert[0m/[38;5;10mNULL[0m/[38;5;10mif[0m/[38;5;10mswitch[0m/range checks/enums over the whole C tree yields two hits, both false positives ([38;5;10m#include <stdio.h>[0m, the include guard). [38;5;10mvoid driver(int)[0m has no pointer (so no null-pointer boundary), no enum (so no out-of-range-discriminant boundary), and no return value (so no error code to compare). The generic boundaries are remapped onto the shape this API actually has — rows B1–B6 — and all are tested.[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mCONFIGS.md[0m** — 20 rows, all checked. Axes 1 and 2 are single-valued (one entry point, which [3mis[23m the lowest-level one; zero runtime options and zero [38;5;10m#ifdef[0ms). The rows come from the two axes that do vary: the [38;5;10mint[0m value classes the C distinguishes ([38;5;10my == 0[0m preimage, sign flip, all ten digit-count boundaries, both [38;5;10m2*x[0m overflow edges, the [38;5;10m+300[0m overflow edge, extremes, plus fixed-seed randomized bands totalling ~45k calls) crossed with stdout state (full/line/unbuffered, many-calls-one-flush, interleaving with caller writes).[0m[0m
