[38;5;252m[1m## Tests[0m[0m
[0m[0m
31 tests in [38;5;10mtests/differential.rs[0m and [38;5;10mtests/subprocess.rs[0m, all passing. Both libraries are reached only via [38;5;10mlibloading[0m + [38;5;10mdlsym[0m, so the [38;5;10m#[no_mangle][0m wrapper is under test. Comparison is fd-level stdout capture, since [38;5;10mprintf[0m from a shared object is invisible to the harness's Rust-level capture. [38;5;10msubprocess.rs[0m compiles a neutral [38;5;10mdlopen[0m host at test time and runs it against each [38;5;10m.so[0m, giving true whole-process stdout comparison with libc's at-exit flush — the project ships no binary, so this substitutes for the driver-stdout gate.[0m[0m
