[38;5;252m[1m## Two things worth flagging[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mThe suite was validated against five mutants[22m, because a green differential run otherwise proves nothing. All five tripped. The informative one: replacing [38;5;10mprintf[0m with Rust's [38;5;10mprintln![0m produces byte-identical digits and passes all 16 value-shape rows — it is caught by exactly one test, the row interleaving a raw [38;5;10mwrite(2)[0m with buffered library output. Without the stdout-state axis, that class of divergence would have passed silently.[0m[0m
